\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. From glory to glory advancing, 
\par We praise Thee, O Lord;
\par Thy name with the Father and Spirit 
\par be ever adored.
\par From strength unto strength we 
\par go forward on Sion's highway,
\par To appear before God in the city 
\par of infinite day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thanksgiving and glory and worship,
\par and blessing and love,
\par One heart and one song have the saints,
\par upon earth and above
\par Evermore O Lord to Thy servants 
\par Thy presence be nigh;
\par Ever fit us by service in earth for 
\par Thy service on high.
\par                            Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

